Description: Command-line tool for digital signatures
 libdigidocpp creates, signs and validates ASiC-E containers with XAdES
 signatures and ASiC-S containers with RFC 3161 time-stamp tokens, and validates
 legacy BDOC 2.1 documents. Formats that are not validated locally, such as PDF
 and DDOC, are validated with the SiVa online service.
 .
